<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32940" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκταῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕξ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>on the sixth day,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τοῖσι πυρετοῖσι ἑκταίοισιν ἐοῦσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aph.</u>
					4.29
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Coac.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				6.6.38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				17.65
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕκτος, μοῖρα</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				14.119.10
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Metrod.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκταῖον: αἱ δύο κοτύλαι,</span> and
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκταίους</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρτους</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">: τοὺς
				ἐκ χοινίκων ἕξ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
